Merge ONLY on G1 outcome T48 or T48N. Same 0-95 cpuset, interleave=all and
four-region lock; -t 96 -> 48, completing lineup-change C3 (operator-ruled
2026-09-22).
- stack_templates/default.yaml: numa FULL_T48, threads 48; ram_gb 69 -> 90
  (69 was the retired 122B); stale 122B header text fixed.
- test_critic_shape_recipe_parity.py: the topology's shape and -t must equal
  the registry recipe's cpu_shape/threads.
- Changes topology_fingerprint (4893e37e -> 50f30ccc): the contention-matrix
  pairs naming :8074 are re-benched by package gate G3.

Derived lean/descriptors/priors/summary regenerated by
`stack_change_pipeline.py update --research-registry` against research lane/dar-lat-3h-v2-t48n-20260927 on this lane; lane/dar-lat-3h-v2-20260927 (T48) on the -t48 branch,
so this head is self-consistent. Phase 7 re-runs update against merged research main.

Unsigned. Part of the DAR-LAT-3h stack-change package
(epyc-root artifacts/operator/stack-change-dar-lat-3h-20260926/).

